<title>UK: First Call in talks to buy UK firm.</title>
<headline>First Call in talks to buy UK firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call Group Plc said on Friday that it is in talks that might lead to the &quot;significant acquisition&quot; of a related UK business.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>By 1143 GMT, shares in the company had risen 1-1/2p to 10-1/4p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
